# Text files are checked out with LF on every system, also on Windows (where
# git would otherwise turn them into CRLF): the tests compare installed files
# with the ones of the repository byte for byte and find marker lines of the
# installers, and mpv, bash and PowerShell all read LF. The images are never
# converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
